Description: Wild OS Videos
 Videos plays the films and clips on your PC: chapters on the seek bar,
 subtitles from the file or a .srt beside it, a choice of audio track,
 speeds from half to double, picture in picture and full screen. It lists
 the other videos in the same folder, remembers where you stopped in each
 one and picks up there next time. Opened on its own it shows the Videos
 folder. Positions and thumbnails stay on this PC: nothing is streamed or
 looked up online.
